# from:length: counts characters and survives very large numbers
>> s := ['ééééééééééééééé'].
Fitarwa rubuta: (s kwafi daga: 0 tsawo: 20), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: (s kwafi daga: 10 tsawo: 20), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: (s kwafi daga: 14 tsawo: 1), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: (s kwafi tsallake: 20), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: ['-'], sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: (['abcdef'] daga: 2 tsawo: 2), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: (['abc'] daga: 1 tsawo: ['9e300'] lamba), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: (['abc'] daga: 1 tsawo: ['-9e300'] lamba), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: (['abc'] daga: ['9e300'] lamba tsawo: 1), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: ['-'], sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: (['abc'] daga: ['-9e300'] lamba tsawo: 2), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: (['abc'] daga: ['nan'] lamba tsawo: 2), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: (['abc'] daga: 0 tsawo: ['nan'] lamba), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: ['-'], sabon-layi.
